Hysteretic interaction of conical liquid sheets from coaxial atomizers: Influence on the spray characteristics
Available
D. Sivakumar;B. N. Raghunandan
Author & Article Information
Physics of Fluids 10, 1384–1397 (1998)
https://doi-org.proxy.findit.cvt.dk/10.1063/1.869663
